@* A broken connection's end tag — a small free-standing label block tied to its port by a
   stub connection. An ordinary diagram node: drag it anywhere, right-click for the
   connection menu (handled by OnDiagramPointerDown, which routes to the owner link). *@
<div class="lf-break-tag" style="border-color:@Node.Color;">@Node.Text</div>

@code {
    [Parameter] public Home.BreakTagNode Node { get; set; } = null!;
}
